{"steam_appid":3433110,"steam_name":"Cinema Theater Tycoon","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3433110/669667891/ea8340086eeb10615508838142ffcb56a1807ad1/1792395663/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1792396626","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257286787/4b0e697e7dd04ce7ca337571136ec7cfb9dd8d1a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1792396626","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433110/ea5ae29004b50217fede9a69fee64e0e060a08f2/ss_ea5ae29004b50217fede9a69fee64e0e060a08f2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794217677","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433110/777142b231be74b99db914043c0f5577f3a29d35/ss_777142b231be74b99db914043c0f5577f3a29d35.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794217677","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433110/dbc6aacfdbb4c17d2e03a0ae2562814ade2f8268/ss_dbc6aacfdbb4c17d2e03a0ae2562814ade2f8268.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794217677","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433110/ce9378bbf5b224d3eaa7a74db1b0d5722d61de43/ss_ce9378bbf5b224d3eaa7a74db1b0d5722d61de43.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794217677","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433110/0b5511fa2e28912e6d6077e0e5c509013cbb3ca0/ss_0b5511fa2e28912e6d6077e0e5c509013cbb3ca0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794217677"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433110/extras/0e992f658866e9798c9a943321924f5d.poster.avif?t=1794217677\" width=1170 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433110/extras/0e992f658866e9798c9a943321924f5d.webm?t=1794217677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433110/extras/0e992f658866e9798c9a943321924f5d.mp4?t=1794217677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cinema is your empire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey in 1906 in Paris, just after the first screenings by the Lumière brothers, and thrive for more than 100 years of cinematic evolution. Whether managing a small independent cinema or the world's most prestigious theater, every decision you make will shape the future of your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433110/extras/cdc313ff60ba9d85974f8fd06bf9ba4a.poster.avif?t=1794217677\" width=1170 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433110/extras/cdc313ff60ba9d85974f8fd06bf9ba4a.webm?t=1794217677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433110/extras/cdc313ff60ba9d85974f8fd06bf9ba4a.mp4?t=1794217677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Design the cinema of your dreams</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cinema Theater Tycoon, customization is at the heart of your success. Build and modify every aspect of your cinemas, from floor to ceiling, with hundreds of items. Create unique screening rooms, upgrade your equipment, and choose every detail with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433110/extras/970a4ee5006607de2b78b52ed2734580.poster.avif?t=1794217677\" width=1170 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433110/extras/970a4ee5006607de2b78b52ed2734580.webm?t=1794217677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433110/extras/970a4ee5006607de2b78b52ed2734580.mp4?t=1794217677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>A journey through 100 years of movie magic</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the key moments in cinema history. From silent films to modern blockbusters, each era is represented with its movies, technologies, and trends. Cult classics, world premieres, and seasonal events will bring your cinema to life across the decades. Host premieres, masterclasses, and film clubs to attract stars and moviegoers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433110/extras/7e8f8afee9f1a20bd97d8208084aa622.poster.avif?t=1794217677\" width=1170 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433110/extras/7e8f8afee9f1a20bd97d8208084aa622.webm?t=1794217677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433110/extras/7e8f8afee9f1a20bd97d8208084aa622.mp4?t=1794217677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Manage, optimize, expand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage every aspect of your cinema, from programming to staff, ticket and popcorn prices, and ensure your theaters are always ready for the next big premiere. Send your film buyers across the globe to find THE perfect movie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433110/extras/486889d495061fb10e81ab029a267bcd.poster.avif?t=1794217677\" width=1170 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433110/extras/486889d495061fb10e81ab029a267bcd.webm?t=1794217677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433110/extras/486889d495061fb10e81ab029a267bcd.mp4?t=1794217677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core2 Quad Q8400 or AMD Phenom II X2 550<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GT 520, 1 GB or AMD Radeon HD 5570, 1 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-4770T or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 660 Ti, 2 GB or AMD Radeon HD 7870, 2 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["SouthWest Games"],"publishers":["SouthWest Games","Dawn Wood Games"],"release_date":"Nov 8, 2026"}